WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.540
Plasma without blowup.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.953
A bound on each particle's kick. So

3
00:00:04.953 --> 00:00:07.105
each doubling of momentum takes real time.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.922
Each doubling takes longer than c over

5
00:00:10.922 --> 00:00:12.741
n; those times sum to infinity.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.449
Claimed: smooth for all time, any data.

7
